ame>Giuliani</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><etal>et al</etal><article-title>Synchronous colorectal neoplasias: our experience about laparoscopic-TEM combined treatment</article-title><source>World J Surg Oncol</source><year>2010</year><volume>8</volume><fpage>105</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">21108835</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="R13"><label>13</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Baykan</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Zorluoglu</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Gecim</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Terzi</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><source>Kolon ve rektum kanseleri. I. Baski, Istanbul:Secil ofset matbaacilik ve ambalaj sanayi ltd. sti.</source><year>2010</year><fpage>148</fpage><lpage>151</lpage></element-citation></ref><ref id="R14"><label>14</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Huang</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Papadopoulos</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>McKinley</surname><given-names>AJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Farrington</surname><given-names>SM</given-names></name><name><surname>Curtis</surname><given-names>LJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Wyllie</surname><given-names>AH</given-names></name><name><surname>Zheng</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><etal>et al</etal><article-title>APC mutations in colorectal tumors with mismatch repair deficiency</article-title><source>Proc Natl Acad Sci U S A</source><year>1996</year><volume>93</volume><issue>17</issue><fpage>9049</fpage><lpage>9054</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8799152</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="R15"><label>15</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Samowitz</surname><given-names>WS</given-names></name><name><surname>Holden</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name><name><surname>Curtin</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Edwards</surname><given-names>SL</given-names></name><name><surname>Walker</surname><given-names>AR</given-names></name><name><surname>Lin</surname><given-names>HA</given-names></name><name><surname>Robertson</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name><etal>et al</etal><article-title>Inverse relationship between microsatellite instability and K-ras and p53 gene alterations in colon cancer</article-title><source>Am J Pathol</source><year>2001</year><volume>158</volume><issue>4</issue><fpage>1517</fpage><lpage>1524</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11290569</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="R16"><label>16</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Nikoloudis</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Saliangas</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Economou</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Andreadis</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Siminou</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Manna</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Georgakis</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><etal>et al</etal><article-title>Synchronous colorectal cancer</article-title><source>Tech Coloproctol</source><year>2004</year><volume>8</volume><issue>Suppl 1</issue><fpage>s177</fpage><lpage>179</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15655614</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="R17"><label>17</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Thorson</surname><given-names>AG</given-names></name><name><surname>Christensen</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name><name><surname>Davis</surname><given-names>SJ</given-names></name><article-title>The role of colonoscopy in the assessment of patients with colorectal cancer</article-title><source>Dis Colon Rectum</source><year>1986</year><volume>29</volume><issue>5</issue><fpage>306</fpage><lpage>311</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3698753</pub-id></element-citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>